This product includes a pure-Kotlin port of xxHash (XXH32, XXH64, XXH3-64,
XXH3-128), located under :core (com.hashpony.core.xxhash). It is adapted from
the reference C implementation by Yann Collet:

    xxHash — Extremely fast non-cryptographic hash algorithm
    https://github.com/Cyan4973/xxHash
    Copyright (c) Yann Collet
    Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.

The port is a clean-room transcription of the scalar reference paths, verified
against the reference vectors produced by the official implementation. No
third-party runtime dependency is introduced by it.

Cryptographic digests outside the SHA-2 family are provided by The Legion of
the Bouncy Castle (https://www.bouncycastle.org/), used under the Bouncy Castle
license.

The in-app monospace typeface is IBM Plex Mono (Regular, Medium, SemiBold),
bundled under app/src/main/res/font:

    IBM Plex Mono
    https://github.com/IBM/plex
    Copyright (c) IBM Corp.
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
    Full license text: licenses/IBM-Plex-Mono-OFL.txt

QR codes are rendered with the ZXing core library (encoder only):

